{"hero":{"id":58,"name":"Vyper","nameRu":"Гадюка","className":"hero_viper","description":"Если нарушаешь закон, главное — не попадаться. Гадюка эту мудрость так и не постигла. К счастью, если она и умеет что-то делать лучше, чем нарываться на арест, так это сбегать из-за решётки.<br><br>Отсидев срок в каждой крупной тюрьме Нью-Йорка и его окрестностей, она сколотила впечатляющую сеть гопников, каждый из которых у неё в долгу. Правда, она заодно сколотила и сеть гопников, которые мечтают её прикончить. Но Гадюка не любит зацикливаться на плохом.","descriptionEn":"Slither in and assassinate enemies. With a powerful weapon (and deadly venom to match), Vyper can slither into the back of teams and assassinate high-priority targets in a storm of bullets.","lore":"When it comes to breaking the law, not getting caught is a pretty important part of the job.  Vyper never got that memo.  Luckily for her, if there's one thing she's better at than being arrested, it's escaping out of jail.<br><br>Having done time in every major prison in the tri-state area, Vyper has built an impressive network of street level lowlifes that owe her one.  She's also built an impressive network of street level lowlifes that want her dead, but she tries to focus on the positive.","heroRole":"Slither in and assassinate enemies","tags":["Стрелок","Увёртливая","Тра-та-та"],"heroType":"assassin","complexity":1,"colorHex":"#A7AD00","iconCard":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/kali_card.png","iconSmall":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/kali_sm.png","startingStats":{"max_move_speed":6.9,"sprint_speed":1.6,"crouch_speed":4.75,"move_acceleration":4,"light_melee_damage":50,"heavy_melee_damage":116,"max_health":780,"weapon_power":0,"reload_speed":1,"weapon_power_scale":1,"proc_build_up_rate_scale":1,"stamina":4,"base_health_regen":2,"stamina_regen_per_second":0.222222,"ability_resource_max":0,"ability_resource_regen_per_second":0,"crit_dam